Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:03.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,Energy gets wasted for a boring reason:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.21,0:00:06.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,nobody trusts the forecast enough to act on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.20,0:00:09.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,In September 2026, I built Agentic Arbiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.42,0:00:12.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,It covers 238 real data-centre campuses across 36 US states.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.70,0:00:14.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Data centres run chillers even when
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:17.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,the air outside is already cold enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.70,0:00:21.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,I pick a real site, and the plant's own limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.20,0:00:25.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then it works hour by hour, deciding when it's safe to shut the chillers off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.20,0:00:28.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,It made no unsafe calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.12,0:00:31.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,The old controller made one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.20,0:00:36.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,Over five real years, that's about four hundred extra hours a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.70,0:00:37.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,And it grades itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.01,0:00:42.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,Here it's missing its target, because the data was patchy during the hackathon window.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.23,0:00:43.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,It says so itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.70,0:00:47.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,Second of 842 teams, out of more than four thousand people,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.39,0:00:49.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,at FortyGuard's hackathon, sponsored by NVIDIA.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.46,0:00:51.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,The UN's Cool Coalition featured it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.70,0:00:55.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Next I want it running live on real sites, not just measured on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.20,0:00:57.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then I looked at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.49,0:01:00.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,Pakistan has solar on millions of roofs, but the grid can't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.63,0:01:03.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,Go over two hundred units a month, and every unit gets re-priced.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.70,0:01:05.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,So I'm building a Solar Home Agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.86,0:01:09.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,It reads tomorrow's weather, then picks when to run the motor and the iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.20,0:01:14.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,Same habit: it remembers how wrong it's been.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.70,0:01:17.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,Moving a few jobs into the afternoon keeps this home under the limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.96,0:01:19.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,About five thousand rupees this month.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.70,0:01:21.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,Nearly nineteen thousand over the next six.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.72,0:01:24.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's a simulation, on one real month of Islamabad weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.70,0:01:28.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,When it isn't sure, it says no,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.38,0:01:30.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,and tells you why.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.70,0:01:33.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,It keeps score against what the sun actually did.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.20,0:01:37.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,But look what it can't fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.70,0:01:40.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,It still wastes most of its midday sun, and buys after dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.29,0:01:40.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Storage closes that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.20,0:01:44.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Next: five to ten homes in Islamabad, over WhatsApp.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.74,0:01:48.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then add them into one neighbourhood forecast, with our distribution company.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.20,0:01:51.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,The solar is already on Pakistan's roofs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.50,0:01:54.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,I want to help the grid see it, and trust it.
